{"version":1,"content":"<p>日劇天王木村拓哉，昨日(26日)會見千葉縣知事，代表所屬STARTO ENTERTAINMENT事務所轉交由前尊尼事務所籌得的2000萬日圓(100萬港元)善款，協助今年8月及9月受到暴雨及颱風「杜鵑」重創的千葉縣災民。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:41:39.620819+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T03:29:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T03:38:11.247385+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:38:11.247385+00:00","content_hash":"7bfb1f357b8dd1ac9741d10758eb8fa029e055784c82165fab39a13d7e9c938b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}